      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Honduran Aron Isaak Morazan-Izaguirre is one of nearly 800 criminal aliens arrested by ICE Miami and its partners this week in the first four days of a first-of-its-kind large-scale enforcement operation partnering state and federal law enforcement.\n\nMorazan-Izaguirre:\n📌Known or suspected terrorist\n📌Reentered the U.S. twice before\n📌Reported 18th Street gang member\n📌In ICE custody pending removal\n\nThis operation is a first-of-its kind partnership between state and federal partners.\n\nLearn to partner with us at https://t.co/wh8ZYUaplp\n\n#OperationTidalWave",
