      "text": "ICE Deputy Director Madison Sheahan swore in 13-year-old Devarjaye “DJ” Daniel as an honorary ICE officer May 13.\n\n🔎After receiving a terminal diagnosis, DJ traveled all around the country fulfilling his wish of being sworn into 1,000 law enforcement agencies.\n\n🥳Amazingly, he surpassed his goal long before becoming an honorary ICE officer.\n\n🤝DJ’s determination is an inspiration to all of us, and we’re honored to welcome him to our team.",
